 "A microfinance lender in Lilongwe has six jobs for agents and five ways to build them: a graph, a crew of roles, agents in a chat, one agent with tools, or plain code. Taller, greener blocks fit better.": "cd1a880fba.mp3",
 "A loan review runs for days and waits for an officer. It needs durable state and a pause for approval, which a graph with checkpoints gives you.": "86c4f4d171.mp3",
 "Build it as agents chatting, and the state is just a transcript, the officer is one more voice, and every turn pays a call to pick the next speaker.": "c9cb39d52b.mp3",
 "But a writer and a critic arguing over a draft is a conversation. Here the chat style fits best.": "c04fb1d276.mp3",
 "Two calls and a tool need no framework at all. Plain code is the best fit, and the cheapest.": "234791b02f.mp3",
 "Back on the loan review, let the model decide each next step, and every run pays extra calls. Where code can route, let code route.": "4b5f831b19.mp3"
